  "host" : "api.moneta.cz:8443",
  "info" : {
    "description" : "+ This API allows the creation of bulk payments \n+ It is possible to submit up to 200 payments. \n+ All endpoints require user to be authorized. The user proves his authorization by sending **Authorization**: Bearer {token} in a HTTP header.\n+ This version v4 of the API supports tokens generated via Moneta Internet Bank and sandbox token generated via api /auth/oauth/v2/token with using client id, client secret, grant_type: client_credentials and scope: vip_sandbox in request body.\n### **Api in sandbox mode:**\n+ allows you to develop or test an API before it is ready for production\n+ the service returns predefined mocked test data\n+ validations are not available as in production mode.\n\n**Note**: Newly created applications must be assigned to an API Plan (**Applications → APIs → + → Sandbox**) before they can successfully access the APIs. Otherwise, requests may return 401 Unauthorized.",
    "title" : "REST API implementation of VIP bank API - PISP v4",
    "version" : "1.0.0"
  },
